WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.370
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.540
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.130
Episode 18

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:15.810
Wait!

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.710
Stop!

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:25.080
Let's go.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.790
Stop! Wait!

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:38.130
Why?

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.810
The king came to me
while I was sleeping?

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.680
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.710
It wasn't a dream.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:56.680
But why does he behave this way?

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:57.950
It's like someone is chasing him.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.420
Donghak are becoming increasingly influential.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.860
I understand, but still...

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.990
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.130
That's right, the king will return very soon.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.260
Fine.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.500
There must be a reason
why did he leave so quickly?

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.440
Make sure everything's alright
and will return.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.640
Of course, it’s better to go quickly,
than wait until I come to say goodbye to him.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:25.440
That's why he left without warning.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.590
This throne now has a new owner.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.490
You could figure everything out right away.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:46.660
All because
that the queen made the right choice.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.100
Queen?

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.200
For the sake of your child

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.740
she sided with the family, not the king.

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:58.240
If so, then for the sake of the heir to the throne

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:02.350
I will close my eyes to the queen's sins.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:09.020
I'll make sure you get more
you won't have to worry about fighting for the throne.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.090
Give up.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.400
I want more.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:14.370
Don't you eat a lot?

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.070
A person gets used to everything.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.280
Previously, the food was tasteless

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.640
but now I like it.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.450
No matter how much we eat, we never get enough.

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.110
On the contrary, hunger is only getting worse.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.880
The little prince is a glutton.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.260
Fine. I won't do it anymore.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.700
Everything is fine with me.
Why are you looking like that?

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.770
Need to take a walk.
It is good for digestion.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.170
But first I'll finish.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.550
The weather is just terrible.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.460
I would like to take a photo in a frame and on the wall.

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:11.290
It's not too late to resolve

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.230
all the misunderstandings.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.870
Let's live the way you wanted.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:18.870
Social distancing.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.640
You are my true anti-fan.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:27.480
I was worried, but now I have found a solution.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.910
So don't love me.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.780
But I still love it.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.850
And I will love, let you have

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.120
all the shortcomings of the world.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.720
I can't help but think about him!

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.560
Terrible place! Let's leave quickly!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.590
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:47.460
I barely had time.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.200
Not a lake, but an abyss of memories.

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:05.250
Then today is our first day.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:07.280
I propose an alliance.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:11.760
Fine.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:17.130
From now on, no social distancing.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.900
What the hell.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.370
Yes, this whole palace -
one continuous memory.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.550
Why are there so few people?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.250
How long has the palace been so big?

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:49.950
Memories Strike Back

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.260
Your Majesty.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:04.740
Your Majesty,
The Minister of War has come to see you.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.280
I didn't find you in your chambers.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.280
Did something happen to the king?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:15.750
No.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.260
You're bleeding!

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.730
Did you get hurt somewhere?

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:30.530
Just a minor injury
after training.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.770
I know it's late
but I came to congratulate you on your pregnancy.

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:37.840
Thank you.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.340
Don't think about rejoining the clan

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:44.050
for the well-being of your child?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.220
I thought we discussed everything last time.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.790
I don't care that you abandoned me.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.860
I still won’t leave you completely without help.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.320
You and yourself

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.990
you know that you cannot cope alone in the palace.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:02.900
Thanks for the advice, but I'm not alone.

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:05.270
And you know this very well.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:08.440
If you need help,

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.310
I am always ready to lend my hand.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:12.480
For you and your child

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:15.450
I'll do anything.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.830
Lately
Popular indignation increased.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.130
News reaches me about the peasant uprising,

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:39.270
I intend personally
explore the situation in the country.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.270
Everything connected with the people is important
and while I'm gone,

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:46.640
you must obey
orders of the Queen Dowager.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.450
This is the king's decree.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:59.690
Since I am now replacing the king in office, I will replace several officials,

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.190
to properly carry out his orders.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.930
Kim Seok Geun will be back

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.430
to your post

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.660
and former Minister of War Kim Chang-hyup

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:09.570
will take the place of head of the royal guard.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.200
Prince Yeonpyeong, who holds this post,

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.310
concentrate
on his duties as head of Ijeongcheon.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:40.430
The king embarked on a difficult path.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:45.070
If even one tries
tarnish his reputation

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:49.610
this man deserves
fear for the safety of your language.

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.380
baby,

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:27.740
you're so cute.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.950
In this life

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.650
do not deny yourself anything.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:44.530
A handwritten letter is just right
to calm a rebellious heart.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.970
Baby, do you miss daddy too?

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.070
Say: "Dad, come back soon!"

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.640
Is he really kicking? Is this how you answer me?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.510
Isn't it too early for the fetus to move?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.710
Very early.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:07.080
Is the child a genius?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.320
My God! I will give birth to a genius!

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:14.720
And why am I so happy?

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:21.100
Your Majesty.

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:25.500
Something tells me
that it would be a nightmare.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.600
I'll be a terrible parent

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.370
a terrible cross
loving father and obsessed mom.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:32.340
Your child is precious.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:34.210
There is never too much care.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:38.180
I'm sure the baby will be exactly like you...

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.880
What kind of horrors are you talking about?

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.220
What?

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:46.820
Why if my child will
like me, is this horror?

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:49.290
It's time to take your medicine, Your Majesty.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.470
To the bottom.

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:00.800
Like this.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.710
Her Majesty called the child her own.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.780
Like this.

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:21.990
And what did they mix in their decoctions?

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:26.630
This medicine is definitely against miscarriage,
and not from dementia?

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:32.340
Horror! What kind of thought attack is this?
Why do I keep thinking about him?

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.540
Everything in the palace reminds of him.

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:56.060
Our king is Cheoljong,
So I’ll embroider CJ.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:59.000
Did you really embroider this in just one night?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.160
It was always interesting
what everyone finds in embroidery.

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:03.400
While your hands are busy,
my head is empty of thoughts.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:04.470
I like.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.840
You are a real craftswoman.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.710
Very beautiful.

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:11.070
This is silk from Jinju, Gyeongsangnam-do.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.810
I thought on windy days

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:14.640
The best thing is to wear such a scarf.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.850
I'm sure His Majesty
I'll love your gift.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:21.150
Here's another scarf for me.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.520
All my muscles were stiff from sitting for a long time.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:27.920
Would you like to play something fun?

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.890
-Of course, Your Majesty!
-Of course, Your Majesty!

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:32.130
Chief Eunuch

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.670
I know! King!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.410
Right there.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:44.910
Chief Eunuch?

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.110
Well, yes, there is a chief eunuch who serves the king.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.780
Yes, that's the answer - the chief eunuch.

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:56.390
So, does that mean? Didn't get it.

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:58.090
Further.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:00.690
Tiger.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.720
King!

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:02.790
Monkey.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:03.790
King.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:04.960
Rabbit.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.000
King.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.230
Dog.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:13.300
This is quite easy.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.410
Whines like an abandoned puppy.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:16.940
King?

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:19.910
Your Majesty.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.510
Do you miss him that much?

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.780
High relationships.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.620
Nothing like that. Don't exaggerate.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:32.960
Lord, what are you doing?

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:36.130
Somehow it's not fun. Give me a needle and thread.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.230
Queen, are you okay?

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:45.870
No.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.140
Not at all.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.610
It hurts so much.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.410
How can a thin needle hurt so much?

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.420
It's all because of hormones.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.350
Due to pregnancy

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.620
I get upset easily. And I have a lot of worries.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.420
So I cry all the time.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.590
It's all not me.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:11.960
These are hormones.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:18.300
My heart hurts so much.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:25.440
It was as if a needle had pricked him.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.010
Your Majesty.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.150
Oh no.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.450
What's wrong with me?

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.620
We're still looking for the body.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.590
Please give me more time.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.030
I can't wait.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:49.400
Moreover, we must hurry,
in case the king is alive.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.000
I will announce the fate that befell the king. Get ready.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.570
Yes.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.040
Now I'm ready.

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:02.310
Some needle won't make me cry anymore.

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:05.210
What a nightmare!

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.650
-Your Majesty.
-That scared me.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:09.350
I almost had a miscarriage.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.250
Is it possible to say such a thing?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.160
Queen.

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.260
What's the matter? You're scaring me.

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.070
Was the king hurt?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.270
His Majesty...

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.810
King

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:35.980
left this world.

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:57.200
What if I couldn't sleep that night?

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:00.440
King

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.070
left this world.

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:16.420
What if I asked you to stay?

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:21.120
Your Majesty, come back to us!

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:25.930
Your Majesty, come back to us!

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.670
Your Majesty, come back to us!

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.770
If I had never come to Joseon

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:38.910
and we wouldn't have met?

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:43.280
You'd still be alive.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:46.580
5 days before ascending the throne

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.180
Go back?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.520
Is it possible to ask a dead person to return?

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.990
What a terrible request.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.660
And the body has still not been found.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:58.490
The cry asking me to come back makes my hair stand on end.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:02.230
If I could, I would crown a new king.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.230
But if I don't follow tradition

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:06.140
and wait for the resurrection of the deceased king,

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:09.440
I’m sure this will backfire on me and ruin all my political plans.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.470
Even if the king is alive

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.940
he will not be able to return to the palace.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:16.950
I closed all the gates

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:18.650
until the new coronation.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.280
Yes.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.450
If we can have a coronation in five days,

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.160
he will no longer be king.

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:28.490
This means that if we kill him, it will no longer be treason.

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.400
How long do I have to wait?
until the queen comes to her senses?

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:42.640
Doesn't she want to rejoin the clan?

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:45.510
I'll tell her to get ready and pay you a visit.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:46.980
ASAP.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.700
Pregnancy Diary

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.010
And why is this needed now?

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:21.540
when you're not here?

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:47.970
Power is bought with money.

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:57.980
My child.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.080
Don't be sensitive to the smell of food.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.320
Don't make life difficult for your beautiful mommy.

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:07.160
Throughout the day, push as much as you want.

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:11.090
But when your mommy wants to sleep, stop.

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:14.560
When the time comes to go out into the world,

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:16.830
come out quickly

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.100
Don't make your mommy suffer too much.

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:24.470
The most important thing is to come into the world healthy.

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:31.980
I really look forward to the day when we meet.

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:41.020
I promise to be by your side

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.160
when you take your first breath in this world.

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:47.760
Even if the world seems strange to you, do not be afraid of anything.

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:34.980
Show respect.

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:38.320
So this was your plan in the first place?

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:42.230
The king knew about the danger that threatened him.

00:23:42.830 --> 00:23:44.830
But for your salvation

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:46.730
risked his life and left the palace.

00:23:48.060 --> 00:23:49.400
What are you talking about?

00:23:58.010 --> 00:23:59.780
Put Prince Yeonpyeong in prison.

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:02.880
-No!
-Your Majesty!

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:04.880
What are you doing?

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:09.550
Why are you taking your anger out on the queen?

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:12.690
The king left the world because of Donghak's followers.

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:20.060
The rebels did not even touch the governor.

00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:23.770
You say they dared to kill the king?

00:24:24.930 --> 00:24:27.240
Do you think I will believe such a pathetic lie?

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:32.440
Kim Byongin, the king was killed by your soldiers.

00:24:34.840 --> 00:24:38.180
You and the queen condemned him to death,

00:24:39.320 --> 00:24:41.480
therefore I personally must take her life.

00:24:45.020 --> 00:24:46.220
Please no!

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:47.660
Queen.

00:24:48.560 --> 00:24:50.730
For the sake of the child in her belly,

00:24:51.630 --> 00:24:53.860
please don't harm her.

00:24:54.700 --> 00:24:57.200
Her Majesty knew nothing.

00:24:57.630 --> 00:24:58.800
Please...

00:25:01.040 --> 00:25:02.540
I beg you...

00:25:12.550 --> 00:25:14.550
Lord! Queen!

00:25:20.890 --> 00:25:22.190
Take him away.

00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:39.210
Are you okay?

00:25:43.050 --> 00:25:44.580
What was he talking about?

00:25:45.310 --> 00:25:47.480
Did your soldiers kill the king?

00:25:49.090 --> 00:25:50.450
You two, leave the room.

00:25:52.890 --> 00:25:54.360
-Your Majesty.
-Everything is fine.

00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:10.510
Someone must be blamed for the misfortune that happened.

00:26:12.680 --> 00:26:14.680
Prince Yeonpyeong was delirious,

00:26:15.310 --> 00:26:17.150
don't take it to heart.

00:26:18.380 --> 00:26:20.780
Why was Prince Yeonpyeong sent to prison?

00:26:21.050 --> 00:26:23.020
I have proof that he let go

00:26:23.020 --> 00:26:24.790
followers of Tonhak who made their way

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:27.790
into the royal guard, and helped them escape.

00:26:27.990 --> 00:26:30.530
They seem to be related to an incident that happened to the king,

00:26:30.530 --> 00:26:32.560
That's why I was going to interrogate Prince Yeonpyeong.

00:26:33.760 --> 00:26:35.230
I should have done this earlier.

00:26:35.800 --> 00:26:37.670
What exactly are you talking about?

00:26:38.200 --> 00:26:40.600
You speak as if Prince Yeonpyeong killed the king.

00:26:40.600 --> 00:26:43.470
Someone in the palace must have handed over to Donghak's followers

00:26:43.470 --> 00:26:46.480
information about when the king will leave the palace.

00:26:47.640 --> 00:26:51.010
It should be someone who has access to information

00:26:51.710 --> 00:26:53.780
This means that this is most likely Prince Yeonpyeong.

00:26:55.720 --> 00:26:57.990
Are you sure it was Donghak's followers who attacked the king?

00:26:58.250 --> 00:27:01.760
You must focus on what is more important.

00:27:02.460 --> 00:27:06.060
Now only your clan can protect you

00:27:06.060 --> 00:27:07.430
and your child.

00:27:08.300 --> 00:27:10.600
It's no use worrying about anything else.

00:27:10.630 --> 00:27:13.340
First you must make peace with the Queen Dowager.

00:27:14.000 --> 00:27:15.240
If you miss this opportunity,

00:27:17.740 --> 00:27:20.840
You may forever lose the chance to mend relations with the clan.

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:45.300
Yeonpyeong, I wish I could be you in my next life.

00:27:45.730 --> 00:27:48.770
"Find evidence." Sounds simple

00:27:48.770 --> 00:27:51.410
and how much work it requires.

00:27:59.320 --> 00:28:00.780
I see everyone is here.

00:28:05.090 --> 00:28:06.790
I don't think it's appropriate

00:28:06.920 --> 00:28:10.860
to gather in the gisaeng house when the king died.

00:28:10.860 --> 00:28:13.000
I deliberately chose this place to relax.

00:28:14.830 --> 00:28:18.330
We can all be honest while we're here.

00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:21.340
Death of a King

00:28:23.010 --> 00:28:25.270
needs to be celebrated.

00:28:30.510 --> 00:28:31.850
Let's have a drink.

00:28:32.180 --> 00:28:35.890
Crowds of rebels are going crazy.

00:28:36.150 --> 00:28:38.650
I am concerned about the future of Joseon.

00:28:40.090 --> 00:28:41.660
At this rate, Tonkhakovites

00:28:41.660 --> 00:28:44.860
Hanyang will soon be captured.

00:28:45.130 --> 00:28:47.830
If this happens, everyone sitting here

00:28:48.160 --> 00:28:49.870
will suffer.

00:28:52.030 --> 00:28:54.600
Therefore, it is necessary to strengthen the security of the palace

00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:57.840
and fortress walls around Khanyang.

00:28:58.940 --> 00:29:01.440
We will declare a state of emergency and restrict entry.

00:29:01.810 --> 00:29:04.050
All suspicious persons will be detained.

00:29:05.250 --> 00:29:07.850
This way we will get rid of all the Tonhakovites.

00:29:11.190 --> 00:29:14.090
Brilliant idea.

00:29:23.330 --> 00:29:26.740
It looks like the queen has lost her mind.

00:29:27.840 --> 00:29:29.810
She has always been like this.

00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:35.780
She thought she had all the power because she was pregnant

00:29:35.980 --> 00:29:39.110
but the king died. I bet she's terrified.

00:29:40.650 --> 00:29:43.250
If she gives birth to a prince,

00:29:43.250 --> 00:29:46.520
this will finish her off.

00:29:48.260 --> 00:29:50.360
Finally some sensible words from you.

00:30:04.640 --> 00:30:07.810
We need to change candles and incense sticks.

00:30:30.830 --> 00:30:34.300
Your Majesty, I'm going to die of a heart attack.

00:30:34.470 --> 00:30:37.510
Why are they guarding the dead man like that?

00:30:39.410 --> 00:30:41.340
Is there anything strange about this?

00:30:44.150 --> 00:30:45.350
We need to hurry.

00:30:48.250 --> 00:30:49.650
Thank you.

00:31:06.140 --> 00:31:09.340
He is badly injured.

00:31:10.110 --> 00:31:12.170
Especially the face.

00:31:12.270 --> 00:31:16.810
So strong that he is unrecognizable.

00:31:40.340 --> 00:31:42.070
Eureka!

00:31:52.920 --> 00:31:55.450
Hey rats, I didn't do anything.

00:31:55.450 --> 00:31:57.820
Everyone who deserves to be locked up says so.

00:31:57.920 --> 00:32:00.620
You are guilty of losing the weapon.

00:32:01.820 --> 00:32:04.660
How can you blame me for this?

00:32:04.830 --> 00:32:07.530
What kind of idiot would lose a weapon?

00:32:07.530 --> 00:32:10.230
Like the one right in front of me.

00:32:11.230 --> 00:32:12.970
The weapons depot was robbed.

00:32:16.140 --> 00:32:17.570
I don't think you're interested

00:32:20.110 --> 00:32:21.540
What is Prince Yeonpyeong guilty of?

00:32:21.910 --> 00:32:24.910
Don't worry. You're not here for long.

00:32:26.050 --> 00:32:27.050
What?

00:32:28.850 --> 00:32:31.220
What does it mean? Us

00:32:31.850 --> 00:32:32.860
executed?

00:32:33.960 --> 00:32:36.130
I can sit longer.

00:32:36.130 --> 00:32:37.130
I like to sleep on the floor.

00:32:37.130 --> 00:32:38.460
Hey, stop!

00:32:44.630 --> 00:32:45.700
OK.

00:32:46.600 --> 00:32:49.970
Let's discuss. We can do it.

00:32:58.580 --> 00:33:00.450
Byeonin sent Cheoljong to the rebels,

00:33:00.450 --> 00:33:02.350
using me as bait to kill me.

00:33:04.650 --> 00:33:06.820
But there's someone else's body there, which means

00:33:06.820 --> 00:33:08.620
the plan didn't work.

00:33:11.130 --> 00:33:14.960
He detained Cheoljong's people to prevent them from helping to return.

00:33:21.900 --> 00:33:25.470
I can't concentrate because of your crying.

00:33:31.650 --> 00:33:33.180
Come closer.

00:33:36.650 --> 00:33:39.220
I'll tell you a secret.

00:33:40.490 --> 00:33:43.130
You must take it to your grave.

00:33:48.130 --> 00:33:49.460
King

00:33:51.830 --> 00:33:53.000
alive

00:33:54.870 --> 00:33:56.910
Yes, sure.

00:33:57.110 --> 00:34:02.280
His Majesty will live in your heart.

00:34:03.150 --> 00:34:04.550
Yours...

00:34:05.910 --> 00:34:07.920
I felt my body from head to toe.

00:34:09.020 --> 00:34:10.220
It's not him.

00:34:10.420 --> 00:34:12.390
From head to toe?

00:34:13.820 --> 00:34:15.690
I'll skip the details.

00:34:18.360 --> 00:34:21.060
-God.
-If he's alive,

00:34:21.730 --> 00:34:24.230
why haven't you come back yet?

00:34:25.300 --> 00:34:27.570
He's either wounded or tied up somewhere.

00:34:29.140 --> 00:34:30.470
-Lady Choi.
-Yes.

00:34:30.640 --> 00:34:32.980
There is a law prohibiting ascending the throne,

00:34:32.980 --> 00:34:35.080
immediately after the king's death?

00:34:35.540 --> 00:34:38.280
Yes. This custom is called Sanibok.

00:34:38.280 --> 00:34:42.150
One must wait for the return of the soul of the deceased within five days.

00:34:42.150 --> 00:34:44.590
The new king can ascend to the throne in only five days.

00:34:44.890 --> 00:34:47.790
Then we have six days, including coronation day.

00:34:49.190 --> 00:34:51.230
They will do anything

00:34:51.230 --> 00:34:53.300
so that during these six days the king does not return.

00:34:55.200 --> 00:34:56.570
How many maids are there in the palace?

00:34:57.030 --> 00:35:01.440
About 250 court maids.

00:35:01.440 --> 00:35:03.470
If you include court servants,

00:35:03.470 --> 00:35:05.510
will be more than 600.

00:35:06.110 --> 00:35:08.740
600 live surveillance cameras.

00:35:09.510 --> 00:35:11.850
If they each say a word, there will be 600 words.

00:35:13.520 --> 00:35:15.080
Let's use them.

00:35:16.050 --> 00:35:17.090
-What?
-What?

00:35:17.090 --> 00:35:19.150
I'll disrupt the coronation.

00:35:21.290 --> 00:35:22.560
Are you with me?

00:35:23.060 --> 00:35:24.060
Good luck.

00:35:24.460 --> 00:35:26.860
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:35:27.830 --> 00:35:28.930
Yes.

00:35:30.230 --> 00:35:32.100
If His Majesty is alive...

00:35:35.370 --> 00:35:38.070
Our state is going through difficulties

00:35:38.470 --> 00:35:40.480
The appointment of a new king cannot be delayed.

00:35:40.840 --> 00:35:43.650
As a king performing royal duties,

00:35:44.350 --> 00:35:46.250
I announce the 32nd descendant

00:35:46.250 --> 00:35:48.820
Prince Minheung, Lee Kyungwon.

00:35:50.220 --> 00:35:52.490
The king left this world

00:35:53.260 --> 00:35:54.960
due to the rebel uprising...

00:35:55.390 --> 00:35:56.860
Followers of donghak who took away

00:35:56.860 --> 00:35:59.160
the life of our king does not deserve mercy.

00:35:59.630 --> 00:36:01.530
I declare that every single one

00:36:01.530 --> 00:36:04.330
the followers of donghak will be destroyed.

00:36:05.400 --> 00:36:07.440
The Tonhakovites brought trouble upon themselves.

00:36:07.440 --> 00:36:08.800
Scoundrels.

00:36:18.380 --> 00:36:19.380
Benin.

00:36:25.890 --> 00:36:26.960
Why did you detain

00:36:26.960 --> 00:36:28.260
Yeonpyeong and Hong?

00:36:29.360 --> 00:36:30.730
The balance of power is changing

00:36:30.730 --> 00:36:32.260
depending on who's on the throne.

00:36:32.260 --> 00:36:34.000
This is not the first time this has happened.

00:36:34.000 --> 00:36:36.400
So be it. The king died just recently.

00:36:36.400 --> 00:36:38.300
How can you detain innocent people?

00:36:38.730 --> 00:36:40.340
Innocent?

00:36:42.200 --> 00:36:44.170
Being on the side of the weak is also a crime.

00:36:44.340 --> 00:36:48.080
Benin, how far are you willing to go?

00:36:50.650 --> 00:36:52.550
I want to become more powerful.

00:36:53.080 --> 00:36:55.280
To protect those I care about

00:36:57.120 --> 00:36:58.850
I need more power.

00:37:05.730 --> 00:37:07.100
Make your lips lifeless.

00:37:07.760 --> 00:37:09.600
You are already a living corpse.

00:37:09.870 --> 00:37:12.570
Then make it look like a real corpse.

00:37:17.270 --> 00:37:19.040
Why go this far?

00:37:20.710 --> 00:37:22.940
The king has only me left.

00:37:24.880 --> 00:37:27.380
Even if they want to get rid of me,

00:37:27.380 --> 00:37:29.680
They won't put a pregnant woman in a cage.

00:37:32.490 --> 00:37:33.720
What do I look like?

00:37:37.560 --> 00:37:39.760
-Like a real corpse.
-Is it true?

00:37:59.510 --> 00:38:02.220
The Dowager Queen has arrived.

00:38:32.380 --> 00:38:35.550
These two are going to put on quite a show here.

00:38:40.090 --> 00:38:42.690
Only the main prize will be mine.

00:38:44.630 --> 00:38:48.430
Your Majesty.

00:38:50.500 --> 00:38:54.440
How could you leave me?

00:38:55.670 --> 00:38:58.610
What about our child?

00:39:00.110 --> 00:39:01.140
Yours...

00:39:01.610 --> 00:39:06.010
Your Majesty.

00:39:10.550 --> 00:39:13.320
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:39:13.460 --> 00:39:14.860
Your Majesty.

00:39:15.890 --> 00:39:17.660
Your Majesty.

00:39:17.930 --> 00:39:21.060
Call the royal physician. Urgently!

00:39:23.600 --> 00:39:26.230
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:39:26.230 --> 00:39:28.170
If I stay even a little longer, I will curse them.

00:39:28.170 --> 00:39:29.240
Drag, drag.

00:39:29.240 --> 00:39:32.870
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:39:34.110 --> 00:39:36.550
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:39:40.920 --> 00:39:43.420
How so.

00:39:44.690 --> 00:39:46.720
How so.

00:39:47.260 --> 00:39:49.490
God.

00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:54.100
How so.

00:39:57.370 --> 00:39:58.570
Did you call me?

00:40:00.540 --> 00:40:02.170
Were you horrified to hear the news?

00:40:02.340 --> 00:40:05.570
What has happened to him in recent days?

00:40:06.780 --> 00:40:09.380
How could he leave so suddenly?

00:40:11.710 --> 00:40:12.810
King

00:40:16.590 --> 00:40:17.720
alive

00:40:19.590 --> 00:40:21.020
I called to tell you this.

00:40:27.230 --> 00:40:28.330
Thank you.

00:40:29.700 --> 00:40:31.400
Thank you very much.

00:40:36.270 --> 00:40:37.370
Listen.

00:40:38.670 --> 00:40:40.310
This is just the beginning.

00:40:45.780 --> 00:40:49.620
We will calm the unrest in the country in four days.

00:40:50.750 --> 00:40:53.490
Thanks to the king, we will get rid of the Tonhakites.

00:40:53.890 --> 00:40:56.790
The rest of the scum will defend themselves.

00:40:57.390 --> 00:40:59.760
Considering what is happening, we can say

00:40:59.760 --> 00:41:01.830
that he gave his life to save the country.

00:41:07.100 --> 00:41:08.570
Until everything calmed down,

00:41:10.570 --> 00:41:13.210
there are some concerns

00:41:13.410 --> 00:41:16.380
that's why I've gathered you here.

00:41:18.710 --> 00:41:20.620
Andong Kims and Pungyang Chos

00:41:20.620 --> 00:41:22.450
have been feuding for a long time.

00:41:23.150 --> 00:41:25.750
We teamed up for a while

00:41:25.750 --> 00:41:27.690
to confront a common enemy - the king.

00:41:27.960 --> 00:41:29.860
But now the king is out of the game

00:41:29.860 --> 00:41:32.230
and I'm afraid that both clans will start to quarrel again

00:41:32.230 --> 00:41:34.000
and compete with each other.

00:41:35.200 --> 00:41:36.230
Before

00:41:37.330 --> 00:41:39.200
let's move on to the agenda,

00:41:40.040 --> 00:41:41.970
I prepared something to strengthen

00:41:41.970 --> 00:41:43.640
union of two families.

00:41:52.280 --> 00:41:55.580
Mutiny at court...

00:41:59.550 --> 00:42:00.820
Replace or overthrow?

00:42:02.220 --> 00:42:03.220
This means

00:42:04.730 --> 00:42:06.090
that you are plotting treason.

00:42:07.330 --> 00:42:10.230
It is hidden in the depths of your souls.

00:42:10.900 --> 00:42:12.900
The king is still dead

00:42:12.900 --> 00:42:15.200
Why leave such a document?

00:42:15.200 --> 00:42:17.610
To share responsibility.

00:42:18.340 --> 00:42:22.080
This will prevent either family from violating the terms of the alliance.

00:42:22.380 --> 00:42:24.710
I'll leave a piece of evidence to highlight that we're in the same boat.

00:42:26.110 --> 00:42:27.750
As long as you agree with this,

00:42:28.350 --> 00:42:31.920
I guarantee that two families can

00:42:32.990 --> 00:42:34.960
coexist in power.

00:42:35.490 --> 00:42:36.790
This means

00:42:37.460 --> 00:42:40.530
that you want to control our lives.

00:42:46.330 --> 00:42:49.100
We can't do this.

00:42:55.010 --> 00:42:57.050
What do you allow yourself?

00:42:57.050 --> 00:42:58.810
How dare they gather soldiers?

00:43:00.620 --> 00:43:02.480
You have to agree with me

00:43:03.990 --> 00:43:06.050
to get out of here alive.

00:43:14.100 --> 00:43:15.530
Kim Byunin

00:43:37.720 --> 00:43:38.720
Your Majesty.

00:43:38.850 --> 00:43:41.760
Yes. Come in.

00:43:48.430 --> 00:43:50.570
-Your Majesty.
-Did you find out something?

00:43:50.570 --> 00:43:53.770
As you said, the palace gate

00:43:54.970 --> 00:43:58.140
and all the gates around Hanyang are closed.

00:43:59.170 --> 00:44:00.240
I knew it.

00:44:01.140 --> 00:44:02.310
What about warriors?

00:44:02.310 --> 00:44:03.580
One place left

00:44:03.580 --> 00:44:05.350
where the warriors continue their search.

00:44:06.050 --> 00:44:07.820
It's next to the cliff.

00:44:08.620 --> 00:44:11.750
I found you, Cheoljong. I'll save you.

00:44:16.320 --> 00:44:18.990
Something makes me sleepy. You need to go too.

00:44:22.960 --> 00:44:24.500
How I want to sleep!

00:44:27.940 --> 00:44:29.340
I'll pass out now.

00:44:29.340 --> 00:44:31.570
Good night, Your Majesty.

00:44:31.970 --> 00:44:33.740
Sweet dreams, queen.

00:44:34.210 --> 00:44:36.340
Yes. Good night to you too.

00:44:36.540 --> 00:44:37.650
Yes.

00:44:41.380 --> 00:44:42.720
Stay healthy.

00:44:44.490 --> 00:44:45.650
What?

00:44:45.920 --> 00:44:49.390
When it comes to health, you shouldn't be careless.

00:44:51.730 --> 00:44:52.990
-Yes, queen.
-Yes, queen.

00:45:25.990 --> 00:45:27.000
Where is the queen?

00:45:27.030 --> 00:45:29.100
She fainted from shock

00:45:29.100 --> 00:45:30.270
but quickly came to her senses.

00:45:30.600 --> 00:45:31.700
Lost consciousness?

00:45:37.940 --> 00:45:39.370
Where are you going?

00:45:52.520 --> 00:45:56.020
This isn't what I'm thinking, is it?

00:45:57.430 --> 00:45:59.660
Are you really ready to go that far?

00:46:02.330 --> 00:46:04.200
-Just move on.
-You won't leave.

00:46:04.870 --> 00:46:07.200
If you leave the palace, you will be in danger.

00:46:07.270 --> 00:46:08.700
Do you think I don't know this?

00:46:09.200 --> 00:46:10.410
I know everything.

00:46:10.410 --> 00:46:12.710
You used me as bait for the king

00:46:12.710 --> 00:46:15.080
and it was you who pointed the sword at him.

00:46:16.210 --> 00:46:17.450
I know everything.

00:46:17.650 --> 00:46:19.880
As long as you're safe,

00:46:19.880 --> 00:46:21.850
I am ready to put up with your hatred.

00:46:22.150 --> 00:46:24.050
Be as angry at me as you want.

00:46:24.320 --> 00:46:25.990
And give up already.

00:46:26.420 --> 00:46:28.260
The king is dead anyway.

00:46:28.260 --> 00:46:30.790
No. He's alive.

00:46:31.790 --> 00:46:34.300
You know, the king is not one to die easily.

00:46:34.660 --> 00:46:37.070
Isn't that why you're in such a hurry with the coronation?

00:46:37.070 --> 00:46:38.170
Your Majesty.

00:46:39.370 --> 00:46:40.370
I beg you.

00:46:42.070 --> 00:46:44.510
You must turn your back on the king to survive.

00:46:47.680 --> 00:46:49.510
Did you want to know why I chose the king?

00:46:50.610 --> 00:46:52.580
I'll answer you.

00:46:53.180 --> 00:46:55.250
If anyone deserves to be king,

00:46:55.620 --> 00:46:57.520
then only His Majesty.

00:46:58.320 --> 00:47:00.490
He is the most suitable candidate.

00:47:01.120 --> 00:47:04.860
So don't even try to make a choice for me.

00:47:04.860 --> 00:47:05.990
If you continue

00:47:12.630 --> 00:47:14.200
you won't leave me a choice.

00:47:15.940 --> 00:47:18.940
Soyeon, how can you point an arrow at me?

00:47:19.170 --> 00:47:20.640
You know my feelings.

00:47:21.880 --> 00:47:24.110
If you loved her so much

00:47:24.810 --> 00:47:26.880
Shouldn't I have understood?

00:47:26.880 --> 00:47:28.720
that Kim Soyeon has changed?

00:47:31.390 --> 00:47:32.420
Look at me.

00:47:32.690 --> 00:47:35.690
Am I really the woman you've been dreaming about all this time?

00:47:35.690 --> 00:47:38.230
I'm a completely different person inside, but you didn't know that.

00:47:38.760 --> 00:47:40.060
The one you loved -

00:47:41.200 --> 00:47:42.830
just a shell.

00:47:42.860 --> 00:47:44.800
-Soyeon.
-The real Soyeon, whom you loved,

00:47:44.800 --> 00:47:46.170
no more.

00:47:47.440 --> 00:47:49.440
What the hell are you talking about?

00:47:54.740 --> 00:47:57.250
The real Soyeon couldn't shoot you

00:47:57.910 --> 00:47:59.980
because I loved you like a brother.

00:48:01.120 --> 00:48:02.420
But I'm different.

00:48:05.020 --> 00:48:07.120
I can shoot at you as much as I want.

00:48:18.770 --> 00:48:20.100
I warned you!

00:48:21.670 --> 00:48:23.370
I didn't want to hurt him.

00:49:03.950 --> 00:49:04.980
What are you doing?

00:49:06.350 --> 00:49:08.920
It was so obvious that we decided it was a hint.

00:49:09.420 --> 00:49:11.520
I came because I want to live.

00:49:11.820 --> 00:49:15.060
When I don't see you, I feel like I'm going to die from anxiety.

00:49:16.960 --> 00:49:18.430
Forget and come back.

00:49:19.690 --> 00:49:20.900
No, queen.

00:49:21.000 --> 00:49:23.360
If you want to go alone, you'll have to step on me.

00:49:32.910 --> 00:49:34.510
Four days left.

00:49:36.940 --> 00:49:38.680
The coronation is in four days.

00:49:38.680 --> 00:49:40.950
How do you search an entire forest?

00:49:40.950 --> 00:49:43.050
and find the king alone?

00:49:45.920 --> 00:49:47.160
Are you smiling now?

00:49:47.390 --> 00:49:48.590
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:49:49.020 --> 00:49:50.930
There are many wild animals in the mountains.

00:49:50.930 --> 00:49:52.630
You won't last long there.

00:49:52.860 --> 00:49:54.600
You may be eaten by wolves.

00:49:55.300 --> 00:49:57.970
Or the warriors may find your frozen body.

00:49:58.700 --> 00:50:02.470
How so. So scary! I'm literally shaking with fear.

00:50:02.470 --> 00:50:04.010
Say what you want: you can't scare me.

00:50:05.170 --> 00:50:06.210
Let's go back.

00:50:06.410 --> 00:50:08.580
Since the queen doesn't want us to go with her,

00:50:08.580 --> 00:50:11.480
we will be punished for not being able to stop her,

00:50:11.710 --> 00:50:14.520
they will force us to drink the cup of poison,

00:50:15.280 --> 00:50:17.850
and we will fall asleep in eternal sleep.

00:50:32.330 --> 00:50:34.300
Fine. You can come with me.

00:50:38.110 --> 00:50:39.370
This is not a vacation,

00:50:39.370 --> 00:50:40.410
why do you need it?

00:50:40.740 --> 00:50:43.080
How will you pass the fortress in Hanyang?

00:50:44.210 --> 00:50:47.220
I thought I could just jump over the wall

00:50:47.220 --> 00:50:49.150
but now because of you it won’t work out that way.

00:50:49.220 --> 00:50:53.590
The fortress in Hanyang is very high, how would you jump over it?

00:50:55.190 --> 00:50:56.520
Are you laughing at me again?

00:50:58.360 --> 00:51:01.430
We've already taken care of everything. You have nothing to worry about.

00:51:14.850 --> 00:51:16.080
Your Majesty.

00:51:25.370 --> 00:51:26.910
I thought we'd celebrate

00:51:27.410 --> 00:51:29.510
but judging by your face, you are washing down defeat.

00:51:29.680 --> 00:51:31.510
What wound can you heal like this?

00:51:31.970 --> 00:51:33.470
Where did you get hurt?

00:51:35.720 --> 00:51:38.490
Once again you will touch my cup,

00:51:38.950 --> 00:51:41.490
and I'll cut off your hand.

00:51:46.360 --> 00:51:48.430
If you loved her so much

00:51:48.820 --> 00:51:50.660
Shouldn't I have understood?

00:51:50.890 --> 00:51:52.740
that Kim Soyeon has changed?

00:51:53.370 --> 00:51:56.260
Last night he looked exactly like you.

00:51:58.910 --> 00:52:01.370
What? Love?

00:52:02.200 --> 00:52:03.700
What an abomination!

00:52:04.180 --> 00:52:05.550
I'm already confused

00:52:05.550 --> 00:52:06.910
and you're talking about love here.

00:52:29.910 --> 00:52:31.110
You're late.

00:52:32.700 --> 00:52:34.340
Go to your place and rest.

00:52:34.700 --> 00:52:37.140
The stove is lit, so it will be warm.

00:52:37.550 --> 00:52:40.220
Why don't you ask anything?

00:52:41.090 --> 00:52:42.780
Because I'm a father.

00:52:53.030 --> 00:52:54.930
What did they do?

00:52:54.930 --> 00:52:57.700
Letter with a plan for treason.

00:52:58.090 --> 00:53:00.870
Without my knowledge? It's very risky.

00:53:00.870 --> 00:53:02.910
Once we get it, it will become our weapon,

00:53:02.910 --> 00:53:04.240
so don't worry.

00:53:04.640 --> 00:53:06.430
I'll bring it to you.

00:53:06.740 --> 00:53:08.050
You are accused of treason.

00:53:08.050 --> 00:53:10.410
If you return immediately after the king disappears,

00:53:11.870 --> 00:53:13.240
it will be suspicious.

00:53:13.720 --> 00:53:15.590
I don't want to go back.

00:53:16.240 --> 00:53:18.010
I'll be happy

00:53:18.860 --> 00:53:22.280
if I can continue to help you from the shadows.

00:53:25.620 --> 00:53:29.120
By the way, I heard that the queen left the palace at night.

00:53:29.970 --> 00:53:32.390
How dare she run away in the middle of the night?

00:53:33.660 --> 00:53:35.610
I didn't tell anyone about this

00:53:35.910 --> 00:53:37.300
but you already know everything.

00:53:37.470 --> 00:53:40.240
Knowing what a queen can be,

00:53:40.700 --> 00:53:42.910
I don't think she just ran away.

00:53:43.680 --> 00:53:44.820
Why then?

00:53:45.840 --> 00:53:49.510
I'm sure she wants to find the king to return everything to its place.

00:53:50.340 --> 00:53:54.680
She must be sure that the king is alive.

00:53:55.620 --> 00:53:59.300
She must have a reason to believe it.

00:53:59.300 --> 00:54:02.070
She took off her dress and left the palace,

00:54:02.070 --> 00:54:03.300
which means

00:54:04.490 --> 00:54:07.030
now she's just an ordinary woman.

00:54:07.300 --> 00:54:09.200
Even though she knows she's lying

00:54:09.200 --> 00:54:12.110
I tried to accept her for Benin's sake.

00:54:13.530 --> 00:54:15.970
The royal couple seems to be very much in love with each other.

00:54:16.740 --> 00:54:20.340
so why don't we bury them together.

00:54:22.490 --> 00:54:24.510
Will you take care of it?

00:54:36.570 --> 00:54:37.590
Mister.

00:54:37.970 --> 00:54:40.870
I have returned to help the Queen Dowager.

00:54:42.370 --> 00:54:46.110
Are these the ones responsible for the death of the king?

00:54:46.740 --> 00:54:47.800
Yes.

00:54:47.800 --> 00:54:49.680
We are just collecting herbs.

00:54:49.840 --> 00:54:52.340
We have never met the king.

00:54:53.240 --> 00:54:56.340
It turns out that they are such rootless creatures

00:54:56.720 --> 00:54:59.010
caught a dragon without even realizing it.

00:55:25.320 --> 00:55:27.590
You jumped up so quickly, apparently everything is fine with you.

00:55:28.140 --> 00:55:29.550
Thought you were already dead.

00:55:30.010 --> 00:55:31.050
Who are you?

00:55:31.050 --> 00:55:33.590
What do you think? Herbalist, obviously.

00:55:33.720 --> 00:55:35.660
Why else would I live in the forest?

00:55:37.430 --> 00:55:38.990
Are you the one who saved me?

00:55:39.860 --> 00:55:43.320
Not really. Let's just say I found you and brought you here.

00:55:43.620 --> 00:55:45.240
You were wearing expensive clothes

00:55:45.240 --> 00:55:47.160
so I thought you

00:55:47.160 --> 00:55:49.010
repay me for saving my life.

00:55:49.010 --> 00:55:50.430
You have to pay for everything, you know?

00:55:51.780 --> 00:55:53.370
But you have nothing.

00:55:53.740 --> 00:55:56.110
The fabric looked expensive

00:55:56.110 --> 00:55:58.820
but I couldn't sell this rag.

00:56:00.180 --> 00:56:01.490
I just burned everything.

00:56:02.780 --> 00:56:03.780
Burned?

00:56:03.780 --> 00:56:07.490
There are warriors walking everywhere and looking for something.

00:56:09.450 --> 00:56:11.930
Was I wrong in bringing you here?

00:56:13.430 --> 00:56:14.470
Collector!

00:56:16.200 --> 00:56:18.260
If you run away without paying,

00:56:18.260 --> 00:56:20.090
I'll cut off your hands.

00:56:21.740 --> 00:56:22.840
Remember.

00:56:34.720 --> 00:56:36.410
I brought you the best ones.

00:56:53.470 --> 00:56:55.470
Okay, okay, so what next?

00:56:55.470 --> 00:56:58.180
So during the funeral they use someone else's corpse.

00:56:58.180 --> 00:57:00.740
If they can hold the coronation within 6 days,

00:57:01.550 --> 00:57:02.570
the game is over.

00:57:03.550 --> 00:57:05.120
How did you find out?

00:57:05.120 --> 00:57:07.340
These idiots are so predictable!

00:57:08.090 --> 00:57:10.840
These idiots deserve to be punished!

00:57:23.800 --> 00:57:25.590
This is the confession of a follower of Donghak.

00:57:26.240 --> 00:57:28.510
I already have an idea of ​​who to blame for this.

00:57:29.070 --> 00:57:30.700
Find the right moment after the coronation,

00:57:30.700 --> 00:57:32.010
to announce it.

00:57:34.240 --> 00:57:35.240
Father.

00:57:37.820 --> 00:57:40.910
Can I ask you to look after the palace guards for now?

00:57:41.740 --> 00:57:42.890
For what?

00:57:44.140 --> 00:57:45.410
I want it myself

00:57:47.180 --> 00:57:49.950
bring the heads of the king and queen.

00:57:56.990 --> 00:58:00.260
3 days before the coronation

00:58:02.300 --> 00:58:03.340
Byonin!

00:58:06.070 --> 00:58:08.050
You're going in search of the queen, aren't you?

00:58:09.070 --> 00:58:11.280
Why did she leave the palace?

00:58:11.280 --> 00:58:14.140
You should know the reason, you are so close.

00:58:14.950 --> 00:58:18.510
The queen is no longer the Seoyeon I knew.

00:58:19.410 --> 00:58:20.410
What?

00:58:39.200 --> 00:58:41.640
I must bring back the king.

00:58:41.640 --> 00:58:45.220
Kind of a flimsy lock. Maybe I can open it.

00:58:52.280 --> 00:58:54.160
There must be a second constipation somewhere.

00:58:54.390 --> 00:58:55.780
I'm surprised you opened it.

00:58:55.780 --> 00:58:56.950
Hon.

00:59:02.390 --> 00:59:04.160
Prince Yeonpyeong, are you okay?

00:59:06.340 --> 00:59:07.800
How did you get here?

00:59:08.200 --> 00:59:10.530
You know, I’m friends with everyone in the palace.

00:59:11.300 --> 00:59:14.700
You were locked here only because you were friends of the king.

00:59:15.680 --> 00:59:16.870
Don't worry about anything.

00:59:17.240 --> 00:59:19.870
I will get you out no matter what.

00:59:19.870 --> 00:59:21.340
You are a true friend.

00:59:22.240 --> 00:59:25.660
Your loyalty is unwavering even in such a precarious situation.

00:59:26.510 --> 00:59:27.590
Certainly.

00:59:28.220 --> 00:59:31.050
You made friends with me not because I am from the Andonian Kims.

00:59:31.550 --> 00:59:34.990
And I became friends with you not because you are a close friend of the king.

00:59:36.890 --> 00:59:38.240
- Exactly.
-The thing is,

00:59:38.240 --> 00:59:40.490
what is now in the palace,
and beyond there is complete chaos.

00:59:40.970 --> 00:59:43.610
They want to pin the king's murder on Donghak's followers.

00:59:44.570 --> 00:59:46.680
I'm afraid innocent people will suffer.

00:59:47.430 --> 00:59:48.510
Even the queen

00:59:49.570 --> 00:59:52.340
suddenly disappeared in the middle of the night.

00:59:55.320 --> 00:59:57.760
What do you mean the queen has disappeared?

00:59:57.760 --> 01:00:00.490
She escaped from the palace

01:00:01.120 --> 01:00:03.360
along with the lady of the court and the maid.

01:00:03.950 --> 01:00:06.390
Benin has just left the palace

01:00:06.390 --> 01:00:08.660
to find her,

01:00:09.800 --> 01:00:11.990
but his appearance bothered me.

01:00:11.990 --> 01:00:13.240
Why are you worried?

01:00:13.240 --> 01:00:15.410
Maybe I'm making it up

01:00:16.240 --> 01:00:17.340
but he looked like this

01:00:18.300 --> 01:00:20.240
as if he wanted to tear her to pieces.

01:00:27.570 --> 01:00:28.620
Mommies.

01:00:33.050 --> 01:00:34.280
What? For what?

01:00:35.390 --> 01:00:36.430
What?

01:00:41.570 --> 01:00:42.590
Everything is fine now.

01:00:43.890 --> 01:00:44.970
Let's go.

01:00:44.970 --> 01:00:47.570
What was that, Lady Choi? You scared me.

01:00:50.010 --> 01:00:51.740
You always need to be on your guard.

01:00:53.030 --> 01:00:54.180
Fine.

01:00:55.640 --> 01:00:58.070
You're always careful. Pass.

01:00:59.240 --> 01:01:00.510
Go ahead, move on.

01:01:01.340 --> 01:01:02.450
Let me help.

01:01:03.910 --> 01:01:05.760
Please be careful.

01:01:06.050 --> 01:01:09.450
Wow, I can't believe you brought so much with you!

01:01:09.780 --> 01:01:10.860
What is this?

01:01:11.430 --> 01:01:13.030
Candied bell root.

01:01:13.360 --> 01:01:14.590
Candied bell root?

01:01:14.590 --> 01:01:17.930
I received them from someone special and treasured them very much.

01:01:18.490 --> 01:01:19.870
You can take it, Your Majesty.

01:01:20.070 --> 01:01:21.700
-Then I'll try one.
-Certainly.

01:01:24.410 --> 01:01:26.930
It's amazing how delicious it is. Try one.

01:01:26.930 --> 01:01:28.110
Hong Young, you too?

01:01:28.610 --> 01:01:30.300
-Well, okay.
-Here, try it.

01:01:30.300 --> 01:01:31.320
Thank you.

01:01:32.340 --> 01:01:33.470
It's so delicious.

01:01:38.390 --> 01:01:41.090
Court Lady Choi! How so?

01:01:41.090 --> 01:01:42.450
-I'm fine.
-Are you okay?

01:01:45.300 --> 01:01:46.720
Yes, everything is fine.

01:01:47.490 --> 01:01:49.570
God, I'm fine, queen.

01:01:49.990 --> 01:01:51.120
- Let's move on.
-OK!

01:01:54.070 --> 01:01:56.530
Where is the king?

01:01:58.740 --> 01:02:00.840
Your Majesty, you were raised like a delicate flower.

01:02:00.840 --> 01:02:02.740
Is it really comfortable for you to sleep like that?

01:02:03.200 --> 01:02:04.910
Yes. I've done this many times.

01:02:06.220 --> 01:02:07.510
Is it true? You?

01:02:08.090 --> 01:02:09.510
Even I have never had to.

01:02:09.910 --> 01:02:11.910
Give it up. This is nonsense.

01:02:11.910 --> 01:02:14.010
And you did a forced march of 400 km
with a display weighing 50 kg?

01:02:14.680 --> 01:02:15.780
400 kilometers?

01:02:20.090 --> 01:02:22.320
Here's a dreamer. 400 km? Come on.

01:02:23.490 --> 01:02:25.430
Well, yes, I exaggerated a bit.

01:02:25.430 --> 01:02:26.740
But I definitely passed 200.

01:02:26.740 --> 01:02:29.110
During winter operations we melted ice and drank...

01:02:30.570 --> 01:02:33.610
Well, yes, well, yes. We believe, we believe.

01:02:34.800 --> 01:02:37.200
Hey! I'm completely serious!

01:02:37.200 --> 01:02:39.510
Of course, Your Majesty.

01:02:39.510 --> 01:02:41.240
I don't want you to catch a cold.

01:02:42.780 --> 01:02:44.910
We can’t even light a fire without being captured.

01:02:45.510 --> 01:02:47.950
I'm worried about how we'll sleep on such a cold night.

01:02:48.760 --> 01:02:50.780
I'm sorry you're going through this, queen.

01:02:51.430 --> 01:02:53.300
That's nonsense. And it's not cold at all.

01:02:53.450 --> 01:02:55.470
Nothing beats our winter operations.

01:02:58.200 --> 01:02:59.390
Your Majesty.

01:03:26.490 --> 01:03:28.370
Turn off the air conditioner, okay?

01:03:29.390 --> 01:03:31.760
I might catch a cold.

01:04:30.530 --> 01:04:31.660
We didn't find her.

01:04:32.450 --> 01:04:34.490
Break into groups and comb the entire mountain.

01:04:34.720 --> 01:04:35.720
-Eat!
-Eat!

01:04:58.860 --> 01:05:01.090
Somehow I have a good feeling today.

01:05:01.860 --> 01:05:05.590
With this sunshine, I believe that today we will find the king.

01:05:16.470 --> 01:05:18.930
-We don't have time for this. Forward.
-Yes, that's right.

01:05:20.110 --> 01:05:21.240
-Let's hurry.
-We have to hurry.

01:05:21.950 --> 01:05:24.910
-Is this the road?
-Yes, queen. Let's move on.

01:05:29.010 --> 01:05:30.340
We're almost there.

01:05:30.340 --> 01:05:32.760
We'll soon reach the cliff.

01:05:33.120 --> 01:05:35.680
You are so confident in your 20s.

01:05:36.260 --> 01:05:37.530
The energy is so rushing!

01:05:39.090 --> 01:05:41.530
-Let's take a short break.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

01:05:51.010 --> 01:05:53.930
I must say the world is brighter now

01:05:54.680 --> 01:05:57.450
when we're outside the palace, queen.

01:05:59.740 --> 01:06:02.120
Before, I hated leaving the palace.

01:06:02.280 --> 01:06:03.280
Well, yes.

01:06:05.050 --> 01:06:06.050
And you, Hong Young?

01:06:06.260 --> 01:06:07.990
What do you prefer?
Palace or outside?

01:06:08.860 --> 01:06:10.530
Where you are, Your Majesty.

01:06:11.280 --> 01:06:13.530
- That's what she said.
-Hey, stop it.

01:06:18.140 --> 01:06:20.070
Queen, they are here.

01:06:21.660 --> 01:06:23.160
Here they are. Grab them!

01:06:23.160 --> 01:06:24.510
Run, you need to hide!

01:06:24.510 --> 01:06:25.700
-OK.
-Run!

01:06:28.570 --> 01:06:30.510
Hong Young, accompany the queen. Run!

01:06:31.070 --> 01:06:33.280
Lady Choi, where are you going? Where?

01:06:34.010 --> 01:06:36.720
Don't you dare, geeks! I won't allow it!

01:06:36.720 --> 01:06:38.120
Your Majesty, we must run.

01:06:38.450 --> 01:06:40.620
-Court Lady Choi!
-I won’t let you in!

01:06:40.620 --> 01:06:41.780
Let me go!

01:06:43.360 --> 01:06:44.530
Your Majesty...

01:06:47.550 --> 01:06:48.570
No!

01:06:49.760 --> 01:06:51.370
Back!

01:07:04.950 --> 01:07:06.240
-Court Lady Choi!
-Queen!

01:07:06.740 --> 01:07:07.840
No, please!

01:07:09.840 --> 01:07:10.840
Take them!

01:07:11.180 --> 01:07:12.590
I beg you, stop.

01:07:14.380 --> 01:07:16.960
No! No need.

01:07:16.960 --> 01:07:20.200
-Lady Choi!
-Queen! Please...

01:07:20.920 --> 01:07:24.500
-Lady Choi!
-No. No!

01:07:26.330 --> 01:07:30.330
-No! Court Lady Choi!
-We must run, queen!

01:07:30.630 --> 01:07:31.880
Court Lady Choi!

01:07:34.280 --> 01:07:35.340
Your Majesty!

01:07:35.710 --> 01:07:39.920
Run! Queen, I beg you, run!

01:07:50.830 --> 01:07:52.720
Your Majesty, I hope you find the king.

01:07:57.170 --> 01:07:58.330
Hong Young!

01:07:59.260 --> 01:08:00.330
Follow her!

01:09:22.210 --> 01:09:23.510
Who are you?

01:09:25.250 --> 01:09:28.080
What did you do to Soyeon?

01:09:43.630 --> 01:09:47.910
How I became queen

01:10:07.860 --> 01:10:10.290
You said you know everything about me and Soyeon.

01:10:11.590 --> 01:10:13.000
Suddenly they came back to me

01:10:13.170 --> 01:10:14.290
all her memories.

01:10:18.500 --> 01:10:21.300
Soyeon still lives inside of you if her memories are still there.

01:10:21.500 --> 01:10:24.000
Hold my hand until you come out unharmed.

01:10:24.000 --> 01:10:27.010
I knew it. You only think about yourself.

01:10:29.540 --> 01:10:30.620
Take them.

01:10:31.680 --> 01:10:32.920
For the queen!
